        "official_en_sha256": "ddca15c05a0a5002f0446bd4dab93805812988288f671d35b19ef9b1e2b67179"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\n子供の頃は、この橋を渡って別の島にいくのは\r\n大変なことだったんだよ。",
        "official_en": "Yeah. It always felt like it stretched on forever when I crossed it as a kid.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. When I was little, crossing this bridge to the other island was a big undertaking."
      },
